### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Get all posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### Search + filter + paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=express&category=Backend&sort=oldest&page=1&limit=5

### Create a post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Post",
  "content": "This is the content of my first blog post.",
  "author": "Pratik Sharma",
  "category": "General"
}

### Invalid create (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hi" }

### Get one post (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001

### Update a post
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Getting Started with Express.js" }

### Delete a post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001

### Not found (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/does-not-exist
